## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo transactional flow for exactly-once
// 1) write to outbox atomically with main write
db.insertOutbox(eventId, payload, false);
db.commitTransaction();

// 2) publish via Kafka using transactions
producer.initTransactions();
producer.beginTransaction();
producer.send({ topic: 'events', key: eventId, value: payload });
producer.commitTransaction();

// 3) mark outbox as published and invalidate cache
db.markOutboxPublished(eventId);
db.commitTransaction();
redis.invalidate(eventId);
```

